-4067-a0ce-2893fead7399":{"type":"text-columns","blocks":{"template--14486593077377__23d4fefd-0325-4067-a0ce-2893fead7399-1678206284db50f2e2-0":{"type":"text_block","disabled":true,"settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Dura_Nop_720x_391906b9-934e-49a9-a384-cecdaaed4d55.jpg","image_width":650,"title":"dura nop mats","text":"<p>Offering a perfect blend of value and durability, our mats feature a classic Berber pattern, widely favored across North America, effectively trapping 80% of dirt and moisture at the doorstep.<\/p><p><em>Starting at <\/em><em><strong>$8.50\/sq ft.<\/strong><\/em><\/p>","button_label":"Buy dura nop","button_link":"shopify:\/\/products\/dura-nop-entrance-mats"}},"template--14486593077377__23d4fefd-0325-4067-a0ce-2893fead7399-1678206284db50f2e2-1":{"type":"text_block","disabled":true,"settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/8900-1_1600x1600_862c9371-9bd1-455f-8831-64573736456a.jpg","image_width":650,"title":"CM VIPER 8150 MATS","text":"<p>The durable looped vinyl surface of this mat removes, hides, and traps dirt and moisture keeping surrounding areas clean and safe. The non-slip backing also allows water to quickly drain out of the side.<\/p><p><em>Starting at <\/em><em><strong>$6.00\/sq ft.<\/strong><\/em><\/p>","button_label":"Buy CM VIPER 8150","button_link":"shopify:\/\/products\/cm-viper-8150-everscrape-logo-mats"}},"template--14486593077377__23d4fefd-0325-4067-a0ce-2893fead7399-1678206284db50f2e2-2":{"type":"text_block","disabled":true,"settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/dura-nop-entrance-mats-3_1200x1200_1_8aa3a7e8-724e-41b1-a791-c77409ca00cd.jpg","image_width":650,"title":"DURA NOP slimline mats","text":"<p>Dura Nop Slimline is suitable for all heavy traffic areas indoors as well as outdoors with an overhang. The heavy fiber and dense construction will prevent this mat from crushing<\/p><p><em>Starting at <\/em><em><strong>$8.00\/sq ft.<\/strong><\/em><\/p>","button_label":"Buy Dura Nop slimline","button_link":"shopify:\/\/products\/dura-nop-slimline-entrance-mats"}},"ded4b1ea-8775-46e6-a90c-0c02c370d2ea":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/cm4500_viperrib_z_52f37aa1-61b3-45bb-901e-dc8515d8366d.jpg","image_width":650,"title":"VIPER RIB MATS","text":"<ul><li>CM Viper Rib Entrance Mats with <strong>coarse synthetic fibers<\/strong> in a ribbed pattern<\/li><li><strong>Absorbs moisture<\/strong> and effectively <strong>scrapes away dirt and grime<\/strong> from shoes<\/li><li>Ideal for <strong>commercial entrances with moderate traffic<\/strong>, widely used in North American retail locations.<\/li><\/ul><p><em>Starting at <\/em><em><strong>$6.00\/sq ft.<\/strong><\/em><\/p>","button_label":"BUY VIPER RIB MATS","button_link":"shopify:\/\/products\/cm-viper-rib-entrance-mats"}},"bf625779-b0c7-41d2-926f-d5cdd1601a8f":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/image_46_1197716e-652a-4b30-a101-87f55fc62d48.png","image_width":650,"title":"viper 2000 poly-plush mats","text":"<ul><li><strong>Low-profile<\/strong> entrance mats with tufted yarns and <strong>PVC vinyl backing<\/strong><\/li><li>Ideal for indoor commercial entrances with <strong>low to moderate foot traffic<\/strong><\/li><li><strong>Highly economical<\/strong> and a classic choice for <strong>effective functionality<\/strong>.<\/li><\/ul><p><em>Starting at <\/em><em><strong>$6.00\/sq ft.<\/strong><\/em><\/p>","button_label":"buy poly-plush mats","button_link":"shopify:\/\/products\/viper-2000-plush-olefin-entrance-mats"}},"55d84dda-3d28-481f-9320-b0ed5223a3c6":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/image_40_2a3fb8af-8d43-48f9-b353-0fa8a04a407e.png","image_width":650,"title":"viper 2500 needle-pin mats","text":"<ul><li>Looped dual-fiber material for <strong>moisture absorption and dirt scraping.<\/strong><\/li><li>Coarse ya