ce! A better price than I could find online elsewhere.<\/p>","author":"Phuong N.","author_info":"Verified Buyer"}}},"block_order":["template--14531103195265__7e0b72f2-ce1f-4c1b-8fe1-56fad5755867-testimonial-1","template--14531103195265__7e0b72f2-ce1f-4c1b-8fe1-56fad5755867-testimonial-2","template--14531103195265__7e0b72f2-ce1f-4c1b-8fe1-56fad5755867-testimonial-3"],"settings":{"title":"Testimonials","align_text":"center","round_images":true,"color_background":"#e6e6e6","color_text":"#1c1d1d"}},"8197058b-a6c0-492a-a384-900baad14571":{"type":"promo-grid","blocks":{"0c6b8480-4fcd-4ca2-882a-47ce811395bf":{"type":"banner","settings":{"heading":"NEED ASSISTANCE?","text":"Email us at sales@canadamats.ca","link":"shopify:\/\/pages\/contact-us","label":"contact us","color_tint":"#000000","color_tint_opacity":0,"framed":true}}},"block_order":["0c6b8480-4fcd-4ca2-882a-47ce811395bf"],"settings":{"full_width":true,"gutter_size":20,"space_above":false,"space_below":false}},"1384e9c6-7888-475d-b9bc-e1542d70f7b8":{"type":"text-and-image","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/viper_8950.jpg","image_width":500,"subtitle":"DEFENDING THE BUSIEST ENTRANCES","title":"TRUSTED ACROSS CANADA","text":"<p>Sourced and designed to last in Canada, CM Viper Mats stand up to the heaviest of usage.<\/p><p>Entrances such as the Vancouver Waterfront Station that sees millions of people walk through their doors each day, have now used CM Viper Mats to protect their floor for many years.<\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":"","button_style":"primary","align_text":"left","layout":"left","divider":false}},"001d4df1-96d4-474f-86a8-c9e886bb2f46":{"type":"text-and-image","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/White_Motivational_Quotes_Instagram_Post_2.gif","image_width":500,"subtitle":"SPECIALIZING IN CUSTOM WORK","title":"ENTRANCE MATS THAT FIT","text":"<p>Our team of professionals ensure that our mats can be made to fit the exact dimensions of your entrance. An oversized or undersized mats at your entrance can ruin the look of an impressive building, but our custom sized mats give it the perfect bespoke look.<br\/><br\/>Since we make them locally, we get your custom mats delivered fast!<\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":"","button_style":"primary","align_text":"left","layout":"right","divider":false}},"35795988-12e6-4b7e-887b-75e6bdb9cd55":{"type":"rich-text","blocks":{"template--14486593077377__35795988-12e6-4b7e-887b-75e6bdb9cd55-1678206211dc006287-0":{"type":"heading","settings":{"title":"All Indoor Entrance Mats"}},"template--14486593077377__35795988-12e6-4b7e-887b-75e6bdb9cd55-1678206211dc006287-1":{"type":"text","disabled":true,"settings":{"enlarge_text":false,"text":"<p>Because of their versatility, wiper\/scraper mats are perfect to be used in standalone applications. <\/p>"}}},"block_order":["template--14486593077377__35795988-12e6-4b7e-887b-75e6bdb9cd55-1678206211dc006287-0","template--14486593077377__35795988-12e6-4b7e-887b-75e6bdb9cd55-1678206211dc006287-1"],"settings":{"align_text":"center","narrow_column":true,"divider":false}},"6f315087-60be-44ba-b8ec-6cfd57556fcb":{"type":"text-columns","blocks":{"template--14486593077377__6f315087-60be-44ba-b8ec-6cfd57556fcb-1678206284db50f2e2-0":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/image_35_23ef5931-de79-4106-a1c8-97eeaee97808.png","image_width":650,"title":"waterhog classic","text":"<p>WaterHog mats are durable, stain-resistant mats with a unique bi-level design that traps dirt and moisture, keeping your floors clean, dry, and safe.  The standard WaterHog mat features a classic waffle pattern.<\/p><p><em>Starting at <\/em><em><strong>$9.33\/sq ft.<\/strong><\/em><\/p>","button_label":"buy waterhog classic","button_link":"shopify:\/\/products\/waterhog-classic"}},"template--14486593077377__6f315087-60be-44ba-b8ec-6cfd57556fcb-1678206284db50f2e2-1":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/image_36_ab6e46e9-63cd-4850-a230-81b3df2ee793.png","image_width":650,"title":"waterhog eco elite","text":"<p>Waterhog Eco Elite Entrance Mats as the name suggests is an eco-friendly and a certified green product. Using these mats especially for your new projects can assist in winning you valuable LEED certification points.<\/p><p><em>Starting at <\/em><em><strong>$13.00\/sq ft.<\/strong><\/em><\/p>","button_label":"buy waterhog eco elite","button_link":"shopify:\/\/products\/waterhog-eco-elite-mats"}},"template--14486593077377__6f315087-60be-44ba-b8ec-6cfd57556fcb-1678206284db50f2e2-2":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/image_34_de725570-2379-4378-b3e1-3671532ba36e.png","image_width":650,"title":"waterhog tiles","text":"<p>WaterHog Tiles are designed to provide scalable flooring solutions for large areas. Bi-level surface effectively scrapes dirt and moisture from shoes, trapping it beneath shoe level to prevent tracking<\/p><p><em>Starting at <\/em><em><strong>$11.85\/sq ft.<\/strong><\/em><\/p>","button_label":"buy waterhog tiles","button_link":"shopify:\/\/products\/waterhog-modular-tiles"}}},"block_order":["template--14486593077377__6f315087-60be-44ba-b8ec-6cfd57556fcb-1678206284db50f2e2-0","template--14486593077377__6f315087-60be-44ba-b8ec-6cfd57556fcb-1678206284db50f2e2-1","template--14486593077377__6f315087-60be-44ba-b8ec-6cfd57556fcb-1678206284db50f2e2-2"],"disabled":true,"settings":{"title":"","align_text":"center","divider":false}},"c64abde0-5f8d-4110-b5cb-fa27080773dc":{"type":"featured-collection","settings":{"title":"","home_featured_products":"indoor-entrance-mats","per_row":5,"rows":5,"mobile_scrollable":false,"view_all":false,"divider":false}}},"order":["main","e281495a-5681-4178-bfe6-9958043fba94","67b8f2ba-b6b8-4595-9c11-fddcd3c81ba4","e9bc15c7-c3dc-4e85-8cea-504027eb75b5","f5efd5ad-e8c9-48db-a80a-4851de8f06dc","4bf2eeb8-ae71-46a7-b400-15a3ac63f168","89ea3b80-51d0-4e37-8c1b-cb832e0ba611","d44a13a5-02f7-462c-